<div class="updated">Privacy Policy — Last updated: August 2026</div>
<div class="container">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<div class="highlight">This privacy policy applies to the <strong>BrewBase</strong> application (Android: <strong>za.co.brewbase.pos</strong>) developed by <strong>NovaNest Studios</strong>, operated by Sydley Nieuwenhuizen, South Africa.</div>

<h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
<div class="card">
<p><strong>Developer:</strong> NovaNest Studios</p>
<p><strong>Owner:</strong> Sydley Nieuwenhuizen</p>
<p><strong>Country:</strong> South Africa</p>
<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@brewbase.co.za">support@brewbase.co.za</a></p>
</div>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<div class="card">
<h3>Information you provide:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Business name, email, phone number, address</li>
<li>Staff names, roles, PIN codes, work hours</li>
<li>Menu items, prices, categories</li>
<li>Sales orders, payment methods, amounts</li>
<li>Customer names and phone numbers (loyalty programme only)</li>
<li>Expense records, income entries, financial data</li>
<li>Inventory stock levels, supplier names</li>
<li>Receipt photos (for OCR expense scanning only)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Collected automatically:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Device type and operating system version</li>
<li>Authentication session tokens</li>
<li>App activity timestamps</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>3. Device Permissions</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
<tr><th>Permission</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Optional?</th></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Bluetooth / Nearby Devices</strong></td><td>Connect to receipt printers</td><td>Yes — printing unavailable if denied</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Camera</strong></td><td>Photograph expense receipts for scanning</td><td>Yes — OCR unavailable if denied</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Location (Coarse)</strong></td><td>Required by Android for Bluetooth scanning only — not used for tracking</td><td>Yes — Bluetooth unavailable if denied</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Internet</strong></td><td>Sync data with secure cloud database</td><td>No — required for app to function</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Wake Lock</strong></td><td>Keep screen on during active shift</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="highlight" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;"><strong>We do NOT use location data to track users.</strong> It is only requested because Android requires it for Bluetooth device scanning.</div>
</div>

<h2>4. How We Use Your Data</h2>
<div class="card">
<ul>
<li>To operate the BrewBase POS service</li>
<li>To process subscription payments via PayFast</li>
<li>To generate business reports and analytics for your business only</li>
<li>To enable OCR extraction from receipt photos</li>
<li>To maintain loyalty customer records</li>
<li>To track shifts and staff performance</li>
<li>To send account and service notifications</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>5. Data Storage and Security</h2>
<div class="card">
<ul>
<li>All data stored on <strong>Supabase</strong> (AWS infrastructure, United States)</li>
<li>Encrypted in transit (TLS/HTTPS) and at rest (AES-256)</li>
<li>Row-level security — each business accesses only its own data</li>
<li>We never store card payment details — payments handled by PayFast</li>
<li>Receipt photos are not permanently stored after OCR processing</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
<tr><th>Service</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Privacy Policy</th></tr>
<tr><td>Supabase</td><td>Database and authentication</td><td><a href="https://supabase.com/privacy">supabase.com/privacy</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>PayFast</td><td>Payment processing</td><td><a href="https://payfast.io/privacy">payfast.io/privacy</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Anthropic Claude API</td><td>OCR receipt scanning</td><td><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/privacy">anthropic.com/privacy</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Vercel</td><td>Web hosting</td><td><a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">vercel.com/legal</a></td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<h2>7. Data Sharing</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>We <strong>do not sell</strong> your personal data to any third party, ever.</p>
<p>Data is only shared with the third-party services listed above to operate the app, or if required by South African law.</p>
</div>

<h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
<div class="card">
<ul>
<li>Data retained while your account is active</li>
<li>All data permanently deleted within 30 days of account deletion</li>
<li>Backups retained for up to 7 days for disaster recovery</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>You have the right to access, correct, delete, export, and object to processing of your data. Contact <a href="mailto:support@brewbase.co.za">support@brewbase.co.za</a> — we respond within 30 days.</p>
</div>

<h2>10. Account and Data Deletion</h2>
<div class="warning"><strong>Account deletion is permanent and cannot be undone.</strong></div>
<div class="card">
<p><strong>Option 1 — In the app:</strong> Settings → scroll to bottom → Delete Account</p>
<p><strong>Option 2 — By email:</strong></p>
<a href="mailto:support@brewbase.co.za?subject=Account Deletion Request&body=Please delete my BrewBase account. My registered email is: " class="delete-btn">📧 Request Account Deletion</a>
<p style="margin-top:12px;color:#666;font-size:14px;">We will confirm deletion within 48 hours.</p>
</div>

<h2>11. Children</h2>
<div class="card"><p>BrewBase is for adults (18+) only. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 18.</p></div>

<h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<div class="card"><p>We will notify you of significant changes by email and in-app notification. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p></div>

<h2>13. Applicable Law</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Governed by South African law and the <strong>Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA)</strong>. Complaints may be submitted to the <a href="https://www.inforegulator.org.za">Information Regulator of South Africa</a>.</p>
</div>

