<p><strong style="color:#4a7c59;">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@brewbase.co.za">support@brewbase.co.za</a></p>
<p><strong style="color:#4a7c59;">Developer:</strong> NovaNest Studios, South Africa</p>
<p><strong style="color:#4a7c59;">Response time:</strong> Within 48 hours</p>
</div>

